      "assumption": "Decentralized, market-driven verification mechanisms will outpace centralized state mandates in efficacy.",
      "if_wrong": "My argument against the feasibility of these regulations would lose its primary economic justification."
    },
    {
      "assumption": "Open-source innovation is the primary engine of long-term economic and epistemic resilience.",
